7. Apple Color Emoji font files
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Font files under public/fonts/apple-color-emoji/ are Apple proprietary font
materials (Apple Color Emoji). They are NOT licensed under the MIT License of
this project, and Apple has not published a redistribution license for use as
web-bundled fonts on non-Apple platforms.

These files are included only as an optional emoji display fallback. They are
not part of the Instant OS MIT-licensed source code. Recipients should treat
redistribution and use of these fonts as subject to Apple’s rights and
applicable law, and consider replacing them with openly licensed emoji fonts
(for example Noto Emoji or Twemoji) for compliance-sensitive distributions.

