9. Vendored source code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Hero Patterns (CC BY 4.0)
-------------------------
Selected tiling SVG background patterns by Steve Schoger, vendored under
src/vendor/hero-patterns/ and used as built-in wallpaper textures (12
patterns, used unmodified; re-colored at run time by replacing the fill
color and inlined as a data URI).

Author: Steve Schoger
Source: https://www.heropatterns.com
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
License text: src/vendor/hero-patterns/LICENSE and
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

pinyin-pro (MIT)
----------------
Self-contained ESM build vendored under src/vendor/pinyin-pro/ with its
LICENSE file kept alongside.
Source: https://github.com/zh-lx/pinyin-pro
Copyright (c) 2022-present zh-lx

@gcu/iso9660 (MIT)
------------------
ISO 9660 filesystem reader/writer vendored under src/archive/vendor/iso9660/
with its README and LICENSE.
Source: https://github.com/endarthur/auditable
Copyright (c) 2025 Arthur Endlein Correia

Embedded quickjs guest bundle (MIT)
-----------------------------------
src/quickjs/quickjs-buffer-bundle-source.ts embeds the base64-js, buffer,
and ieee754 packages (Copyright (c) Feross Aboukhadijeh and contributors,
MIT).

