  Research / personal use only — NOT cleared for commercial redistribution
  (see public/assets/demucs/licenses/ and docs/demucs-model-license.md)
- public/assets/mdx/ — UVR-MDX-NET source-separation weights (KUIELab
  MDX-Net / UVR) (see docs/mdx-model-license.md)
- public/assets/phoneme/ — wav2vec2-lv-60-espeak-cv-ft phoneme model,
  Apache-2.0 (see public/assets/phoneme/licenses/)
- public/assets/sense-voice/, public/assets/zipformer-ctc/,
  public/assets/zipformer-ctc-en/ — sherpa-onnx speech models (k2-fsa),
  Apache-2.0
- public/assets/tokenizers/ — see section 3 above
- public/assets/attunebench/ — AttuneBench evaluation conversations
  (Test Samples from https://github.com/Thoughtful-Lab/attunebench).
